( FizzBuzz from 1 to 15. )
( Exercises ranged for loops, modulo, and nested if-else ladders. )
For i from 1 to 15:
    If i mod 3 is equal to 0 then:
        If i mod 5 is equal to 0 then:
            Say "FizzBuzz".
        Else:
            Say "Fizz".
        End if.
    Else:
        If i mod 5 is equal to 0 then:
            Say "Buzz".
        Else:
            Say i.
        End if.
    End if.
End for.
